pair:PredictionQueue dct:source <https://mercari.github.io/ml-system-design-pattern/Serving-patterns/Asynchronous-pattern/design_en.html> .   # via pat:AsynchronousPredictionMotif
pair:PredictionRequest dct:source <https://mercari.github.io/ml-system-design-pattern/Serving-patterns/Asynchronous-pattern/design_en.html> .   # via pat:AsynchronousPredictionMotif
pair:PredictionResult dct:source <https://mercari.github.io/ml-system-design-pattern/Serving-patterns/Asynchronous-pattern/design_en.html> .   # via pat:AsynchronousPredictionMotif
