# --- refinements introduced for annotation precision ----------------------

pair:DocumentChunk dct:source "Project curation: a refinement of the role vocabulary introduced for annotation precision. It inherits the grounding of pair:ResourceRole." .
pair:ExternalModel dct:source "Project curation: a refinement of the role vocabulary introduced for annotation precision. It inherits the grounding of pair:ExternalDependency." .
